    "body": "Is the goal here just to keep someone else from putting legacycaller on some interface?\r\n\r\nIt's not clear to me why the spec (and possibly implementation) churn here is that desirable.  In practice, at least for Gecko, we'd just leave legacycaller in our IDL, because the thing that needs to spit out the [[Call]] uses the IDL as input anyway...",
