    "body": "@TimothyGu I think we should stick with the existing spec/what was in IDL for null vs. undefined. It's been in the spec a long time, and we shouldn't be punishing Firefox and WebKit for following the spec. We need some WPTs for it, to be sure, but we shouldn't change it.",
