    "updated_at": "2017-09-05T06:40:57Z",
    "body": "All, a new batch of stuff.\r\n\r\n- Reverted the change to return undefined in favor of the current spec (returning null) per https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2932#issuecomment-326714425 / d6ee73056877f8c52a2cf14e7cd1cb9e6eefefb8\r\n- Use Infra terminology: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2932#pullrequestreview-60266017 / 152c2c0fa6f7159d1e458e2c261e66a1d8bba55b\r\n- Make document.all.item(undefined) return the element with id \"undefined\" if there is one / ec03b38df55f8fddf115d9c704babd0710966ccc. See [compat report](  https://github.com/TimothyGu/document-all-undefined/blob/58bba5b49befe0cd71fbb3d9749e176e8c77c6e9/index.html#L37-L47).",
