    "updated_at": "2017-09-08T15:41:29Z",
    "body": "I think it's more important to play nicely with browsers that have taken pains to be spec-compliant, than it is to conform to the majority of browsers which haven't been paying attention---at least in cases where we don't believe there to be any compat concerns.\r\n\r\nWould either of you mind reviewing this and the tests, now that I've stuck my fingers in them and so it'd be good to get a review of my work?",
