    "body": "This ended up being editorial since we preserved the spec behavior (which was last touched in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/93cc395912de3a9824fdf35e8d9395f7ddb7c003). But I'll take this opportunity to file browser bugs now that @TimothyGu has contributed a great comprehensive test suite.\r\n\r\n- https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1398354\r\n- https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/platform/issues/13650994/\r\n- https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=591605",
